# 🏥 Prior Authorization Workflow Simulator

An interactive healthcare workflow simulator built as part of the ABTalks 60-Day Coding Challenge (Day 26).

## 📌 Overview

The Prior Authorization Workflow Simulator demonstrates how healthcare providers and insurance companies manage approval requests before treatments, procedures, or medications are authorized.

The simulator walks users through each stage of the authorization process using an interactive workflow.

## ✨ Features

- Patient Registration
- Insurance Verification
- Authorization Request Submission
- Clinical Review
- Decision Making
- Patient & Provider Notification
- Interactive workflow visualization
- Progress tracking
- Decision-based simulation

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- HTML/CSS
- Claude AI (Planning & Workflow Design)


## 🚀 Learning Outcomes

- Understanding healthcare business workflows
- Process simulation design
- Decision-based workflow logic
- Interactive application development
- Business process visualization

